.DS_Store

# Local AI/editor/tooling state anywhere in this repo
**/.trellis/
**/.agents/
**/.codex/
**/.claude/
**/.kiro/

# Local presentation and manuscript materials
/cgat-overview/
/ppt/
/paper/
/Genome-Repair-Tools/

# Common dependency/build outputs
**/node_modules/
**/target/
**/src-tauri/gen/

# Local documentation source, toolchain, and deployment artifacts.
# Keep redirect pages, Comet docs, and explicitly versioned design specifications.
/docs/*
!/docs/index.html
!/docs/404.html
!/docs/comet/
!/docs/comet/**
!/docs/design/
/docs/design/*
!/docs/design/frontend-design-alignment.md
!/docs/design/frontend-upgrade-tasks.md
/docs_deploy/
/DOCS_DEPLOY.md
/package.json
/package-lock.json

# Local runtime artifacts
/tmp/
**/*.sqlite
**/*.zip
**/imported/
**/exports/
# Local Comet/CodeGraph agent management
/.comet/
/.codegraph/
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
# The Comet managed block below re-includes .comet/config.yaml; .comet/.gitignore
# keeps it local and is itself outside that block, so comet init/update cannot
# re-expose it.

# >>> Comet managed project state >>>
!/.comet/
/.comet/*
!/.comet/config.yaml
# <<< Comet managed project state <<<
